Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It might help to visit Claire, if you don't already know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She lives in the yellow southern-style house,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.85,0:00:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,right of the big square in Uptown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You should visit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've said enough about Providence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You need my food, not my words. It speaks too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All my talk of Providence may fill my guests before they start eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I'll be quiet.
